{"path":"iterator/istreambuf_iterator/operator_arith","title":"std::istreambuf_iterator<CharT,Traits>::operator++, operator++(int)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::istreambuf_iterator&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator++, operator++<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(int)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/istreambuf_iterator/operator_arith","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"Advances the iterator by calling sbuf_->sbumpc() where sbuf_ is the stored pointer to the stream buffer.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">istreambuf_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* proxy */</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Advances the iterator by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sbuf_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sbumpc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> where <code>sbuf_</code> is the stored pointer to the stream buffer.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if the iterator is end-of-stream iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> A <code>proxy</code> object holding the current character obtained via <span class=\"t-lc\">operator*()</span> and the <code>sbuf_</code> pointer. Dereferencing a <code>proxy</code> object with <code>operator*</code> yields the stored character.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> The name <code>proxy</code> is for exposition only.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"iterator","title":"Iterator library"},{"path":"iterator/istreambuf_iterator","title":"std::istreambuf_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::istreambuf_iterator<CharT,Traits>::operator++, operator++(int)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Advances the iterator by calling sbuf_->sbumpc() where sbuf_ is the stored pointer to the stream buffer."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":79,"codeBlockCount":0}
